GIVEN instrument IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the row names an instrument other than this Act` MEANS
        NOT (instrument EQUALS "")
    AND NOT (instrument EQUALS "Superannuation Guarantee (Administration) Act 1992")

#ASSERT count `internal references` EQUALS 317
#ASSERT count `references to another instrument` EQUALS 121

